OL,3,GNEWSASkateboarders complete Amsterdam
OL,4,Acharity challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo lifelong friends have skateboarded
OL,7,F310 miles (500km) from the UK to the
OL,8,FNetherlands for a charity fundraising
OL,9,Fchallenge.
OL,11,FCharlie Hutchings-Sait and Dan Lee set
OL,12,Foff from central London on Friday,
OL,13,Ftravelled through Kent, northern France
OL,14,Fand Belgium, before reaching Amsterdam
OL,15,Fon Saturday.
OL,17,FThe pair, from New Milton, Hampshire
OL,18,Fand Southbourne have raised more than
OL,19,F#3,000 for the Alzheimer's Society,
OL,20,FMacmillan Cancer Support and road
OL,21,Fsafety charity Brake.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
